## LaTeX artifacts

# ==============================================================================
# VS Code e Arquivos de Sistema
# ==============================================================================
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace
.history/
.DS_Store

# ==============================================================================
# Núcleo de Compilação do LaTeX
# ==============================================================================
*.aux
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.fls
*.out
*.toc
*.fmt
*.fot
*.cb
*.cb2
*.xdv
*-converted-to.*

